{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的音乐与情绪细节比 X 概括，缺少 X 那种随乐句出现的细微转折、身体感受和具体声音质感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的叙述更容易让没读过原文的观众直接跟上人物的心理变化，尤其是每次想念、愤怒、孤独和犹豫之间的因果关系，前后也更像一段连续发生的内心故事。X 的关键词高亮和音乐感受的定时出现很有优势，细腻度明显更高，但部分短时段感受信息过密，容易让观众忙于接收碎片而顾不上主线。综合边听边扫、理解人物和保持叙事连贯的实际体验，我选 Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9ff3e64d-546b-48e3-8309-61ac530e3db9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T213858076773Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:40:16.082005+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bfbe1317b0526c3574e2b1d0a4796f19710fa28d5915127d272b8ec16e93bc4b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": 